hadiths[42]{hadithnumber,text}:
"488","Abu Hurairah narrated that:the Prophet said: ""The best day that the sun has risen upon is Friday. On it Adam was created"
"489","Anas bin Malik narrated that :the Prophet said: ""Seek out the hour that is hoped for on Friday after Asr until the sun has set"
"490","Kathir bin Abdullah bin Amr bin Awf Al-Muzani narrated from his father"
"491","Abu Hurairah narrated:""Allah's Messenger said: The best day that the sun has risen upon is Friday. On it Adam was created"
"492","Salim narrated from his father"
"493","Salim narrated:(Another chain) from Abdullah bin Umar from the Prophet which is similar"
"494","And Yunus and Ma'mar reported"
"495","(Another chain reaching to Az-Zuhri) with this Hadith.Malik reported this Hadith from Az-Zuhri"
"496","Aws bin Aws narrated:""Allah's Messenger said to me: 'Whoever performs Ghusl on Friday"
"497","Samurah bin Jundah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: ""Whoever performs Wudu on Friday"
"498","Abu Hurairh narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: ""Whoever performs Wudu"
"499","Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: ""Whoever performs Ghusl on Friday - the Ghusl for Janabah - then he goes"
"500","Abu Al-Ja'd - meaning Ad-Damri - narrated"
"501","Thuwair narrated from a man among the people of Quba"
"502","Narrator not mentioned:I heard Ahmad bin Husain saying: ""We were with Ahmad bin Hanbal"
"503","Anas bin Malik narrated:""The Prophet would pray the Friday prayer when the sun was declining"
"504","(Another chain) from Anas"
"505","Ibn Umar narrated:""The Prophet would give the Khutbah next to the trunk of a date palm. When he [the Prophet] began using the Minbar the trunk cried out for him until he came to it and held it"
"506","Ibn Umar narrated:""The Prophet would give a Khutbah on Friday"
"507","Jabir bin Samurah narrated:""I would pray with the Prophet"
"508","Safwan bin Ya'la bin Umayyah narrated from his father who said:""I heard the Prophet reciting"
"509","Abdullah bin Mas'ud narrated:""When Allah's Messenger descending the Minbar he would face our direction"
"510","Jabir bin Abdullah narrated:""The Prophet was delivering a Khutbah on Friday when a man came. The Prophet said: 'Have you prayed?' He said no. So he said: 'Then stand and pray.'"" Abu Eisa said: This Hadith is Hasan Sahih [It is the most correct thing about this topic]"
"511","Iyad bin Abdullah bin Abi Sarh narrated:""Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri entered (the mosque) on Friday while Marwan was giving the Khutbah"
"512","Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: ""Whoever said: 'Be quiet' while the Imam is giving the Khutbah then he has committed Laghw (useless activity)"
"513","Sahl bin Ma'adh bin Anas al Jahni narrated from his father that :Allah's Messenger said: ""Whoever steps over the necks of the people on Friday"
"514","Sahl bin Ma'adh narrated from his father:""The Prophet prohibited Al-Habwah on Friday while the Imam is delivering the Khutbah"
"515","Husain narrated:""I heard Umarah bin Rawaibah Ath-Thaqafi - while Bishr bin Marwan was delivering Khutbah and raising his hands in supplication - so Umarah said: 'May Allah disgrace these two insignificant hands"
"516","As-Sa'ib bin Yazid narrated:""The Adhan during the time of Allah's Messenger"
"517","Anas bin Malik narrated:""Allah's Messenger would talk as necessary after descending from the Minbar"
"518","Anas narrated:""I saw the Prophet"
"519","Ubaidullah bin Abi Rafi the freed slave of Allah's Messenger said:""Marwan left Abu Hurairah in charge of Al-Madinah and he went to Makkah. So Abu Hurairah led us in Salat in Friday"
"520","Ibn Abbas narrated:""For the Fajr prayer on Friday"
"521","Salim narrated from his father:""The Prophet would pray two Rak;ah after the Friday prayer"
"522","Nafi narrated about Ibn Umar:""When he prayed the Friday prayer"
"523","Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: ""Whoever among you is to pray after the Friday prayer"
"524","Abu Hurairah narrated that :the Prophet said: ""Whoever catches a Rak'ah of the Salat then he has caught the Salat"
"525","Sahl bin Sa'd narrated:""We would not have lunch during the time of Allah's Messenger"
"526","Ibn Umar narrated that :the Prophet said: ""When one of you becomes sleepy during the Friday prayer"
"527","Ibn Abbas narrated:""The Prophet sent Abdullah bin Rawahah to lead a military detachment"
"528","Al-Bara bin Azib narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: ""It is a duty for the Muslims"
"529","Al-Bara bin Azib narrated:(Another route for the same chain) similar in meaning"